### Public aggregation
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/articles?limit=12

### Existing story route data
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/articles/featured/story

### Recruitment openings
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/articles/recruitment-settings

### Manager drafts; supply token locally
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/articles/manage
Authorization: Bearer {{manager_access_token}}
